        "detailed_description": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Challenging and Addictive</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Stacking fridges has never been this addictive. Your goal is to balance fridge after fridge, climbing to a new high-score. Compete against your friends scores and global leader-boards to become the ultimate fridge stacker!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4004380/extras/aeb0518dfd1e930a9fe661c26e8dfd07.poster.avif?t=1759395626\" width=650 height=150 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4004380/extras/aeb0518dfd1e930a9fe661c26e8dfd07.webm?t=1759395626\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4004380/extras/aeb0518dfd1e930a9fe661c26e8dfd07.mp4?t=1759395626\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Made for the Second Screen</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Got a video to watch, or a podcast to listen to? This game is perfect to keep you entertained whilst your mind focuses on your main monitor. The controls are simple and the concept even simpler, but be warned, you will soon find yourself paying a little too much attention.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Have you stacked Fridges?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Will you stack Fridges?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >When will you stack Fridges?</p>",
